$ korod
verbal root :: to die

#verb

- example :: kafâlem-sin borgîn mûmbid korodâlem-tod
    - parse :: go.Finite.1SgSubject-If city.Dative corpse.Adjective die.Finite.1SgSubject-Then
    - translation :: If I go to the dead city, then I (will) die.
